# Branching Timeline counts only the three differently named lands Bot1 controls (Forest, Island, Plains): Bot2's
# Mountain would make four if the controller were ignored. It reveals exactly three cards from Bot1's library, puts
# both the artifact and creature there onto the battlefield tapped, leaves the fourth card on top, and bottoms the
# nonpermanent. Bot2's matching library cards stay untouched.
